# iCalendar feeds (agenda/): RFC 5545 requires CRLF. Stored and served byte for byte,
# never converted by core.autocrlf on a Windows checkout.
*.ics -text

# Third-party libraries (vendor/): checked by Subresource Integrity in index.html, so a single
# converted line ending would make the browser refuse the file. Byte for byte, like the feeds.
vendor/** -text
